SUMMARY:Special Event: Maddy Kelly
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 1510 SE 9th Ave\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Maddy Kelly  is a writer and stand-up comedian based in New Yo
 rk City\, originally from Vancouver. Known for her sharp wit and viral soci
 al media clips\, she has amassed millions of views on platforms like TikTok
 . She has written for Canada’s long-running news satire show\,  This Hou
 r Has 22 Minutes . In 2025\, she won a Canadian Screen Award for Best Writi
 ng in a Variety or Sketch Comedy Program for her work on  Check This Out.
   Kelly is a co-host and writer for the Webby Award-winning CBC podcast se
 ries including  Let’s Make a Sci-Fi\, Let’s Make a Rom-Com\,  and  L
 et’s Make a Horror.  Named a "New Face of Comedy" at the 2023 Just For L
 aughs festival\, she has appeared on CTV’s  The Standup Show with Jon Do
 re  and CBC Radio’s  The Debaters . Maddy was a featured comic at the r
 ecent SXSW comedy festival and is actively touring with live dates schedule
 d through 2026.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 f
 ood & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n- Ticket Protection\n\n
